sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Field Officer
    participant App as Flutter app<br/>(login_screen.dart)
    participant API as ApiClient<br/>(api_client.dart)
    participant BE as Spring Boot jar<br/>(AuthController)
    participant H2 as H2 DB
    participant Local as Local SQLite<br/>(sqflite)

    U->>App: type username + password,<br/>tap "Log in · প্রবেশ"
    App->>API: Repository().api.login(user, pass)
    API->>BE: POST /api/auth/login<br/>{ username, password }

    rect rgb(247, 228, 222)
        Note over BE,H2: Auth is MOCKED in this build —<br/>AuthController just checks the username string.<br/>NO database read or write happens here.
    end
    BE-->>API: 200 { role, profile }
    API-->>App: response (ignored if offline)

    App->>App: state.appLogin()<br/>loggedIn = true → show HomeScreen

    Note over App,Local: Home data does NOT come from the server —<br/>it is read from the on-device offline store.
    App->>Local: SELECT * FROM beneficiaries
    Local-->>App: seeded case list
    App-->>U: Home screen with today's visits
